      "design_implication": "Prototyping multimodal design tools often hits latency bottlenecks when handling large video and document contexts. Access to a fast, high-context model with native structured output allows interface tools to parse complex design files and return actionable layout suggestions instantly. Start by testing how quickly your prototyping harness can pass annotated multi-page document states into a high-context endpoint without dropping user context.",
