      "title": "Parallel web search defaults to fast mode for agents on Vercel AI Gateway",
      "summary": "Vercel has made parallel web search in fast mode free on AI Gateway and eve through January 31, 2027. The tool works with any model, returning relevant web pages with links and short excerpts that can be filtered by website or publication date.",
      "key_facts": [
        "Free on AI Gateway and eve through January 31, 2027",
        "Acts as default web search for agents in eve",
        "Returns links and short excerpts with website and date filtering"
      ],
      "design_implication": "When an agentic UI dynamically queries live web data to populate interface components, inconsistent search formatting and slow response times break layout continuity. Having a standardized, fast search primitive that returns structured excerpts enables designers to predict how dynamic source cards will render. Start by building component states that gracefully handle external search snippets returned with publication metadata.",
      "implication_lens": "pattern",
      "visual_need": "none",
      "source_name": "Vercel Blog",
      "source_url": "https://vercel.com/changelog/parallel-web-search-is-free-on-ai-gateway-and-eve-through-january-31",
